      "comment": "NEW SHERIFF (7) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Daintree Gav (25.47) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Makes plenty of appeal. TROPIC SANDS (1) settled back but wound up strongly to score by 3.5 lengths (25.50) at Warrnambool in Grade 5. Failed to fire only run here. One of the leading chances again. REV IAN (2) settled back but wound up strongly to score by one length (35.24) at The Meadows in Grade 5. Has failed to finish in the placings from three starts here. Deserves serious consideration again. ZIPPING SIGRID (3) cannot be left out over a shorter distance.",
